WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.830
What are the chances of rolling a six?

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:06.940
A fair die has 6 faces, all equally likely.

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.220
Only one of them is a six.

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:11.600
So the chance is 1 out of 6.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:17.250
An even number? Three faces: 2, 4 and 6.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:21.013
3 out of 6, which is one half.
